<div class="advisement">
<strong>Prototype — partial rendering.</strong>
This page is a <a href="https://github.com/adobe/spectrum-design-data/issues/1006">Bikeshed evaluation prototype</a>
for <a href="https://github.com/adobe/spectrum-design-data">adobe/spectrum-design-data</a>.
It renders five chapters only: Overview, Token format, Taxonomy, Agent-readable surface, and a Rules excerpt.
The canonical multi-page spec and all normative sibling documents live at
<a href="https://github.com/adobe/spectrum-design-data/tree/main/packages/design-data-spec/spec">adobe/spectrum-design-data</a>.
</div>

